usage: gossamer cite [-h] [--style {bibtex,csl-json,apa,mla}] [--enrich]
                     [--no-dedupe] [--from-pdf] [--cache-dir CACHE_DIR]
                     [--config CONFIG] [--keystore KEYSTORE]
                     [--log-level LOG_LEVEL]
                     [--fetch-mode {auto,browser,static}]
                     results [results ...]

positional arguments:
  results               DOIs, URLs, local PDF paths, or JSON result objects

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --style {bibtex,csl-json,apa,mla}
  --enrich              One canonical DOI lookup per unique DOI to fill in a
                        missing venue/abstract (best-effort)
  --no-dedupe           Keep records sharing a DOI/URL instead of collapsing
                        them
  --from-pdf            Treat every input as a local PDF and cite its detected
                        DOI
  --cache-dir CACHE_DIR
                        Cache directory (default: ./.gossamer_cache)
  --config CONFIG       Explicit gossamer.json path
  --keystore KEYSTORE   Explicit keys.json path
  --log-level LOG_LEVEL
                        DEBUG/INFO/WARNING/ERROR (default WARNING)
  --fetch-mode {auto,browser,static}
                        Baseline render strategy for page fetches: auto
                        (default), browser, or static (env GOSSAMER_FETCH_MODE
                        / gossamer.json fetch_mode)
